{
  "_comment": [
    "The applied schema of project qxdpsomelzpvphkhkqrw, read back from",
    "information_schema and pg_proc after migrations 0001-0037. Not used at runtime.",
    "",
    "Its job is to keep apps/web/src/lib/database.types.ts honest. Those types",
    "are hand-written on purpose: `supabase gen types` widens every CHECK",
    "constraint to `string` and every jsonb column to `Json`, which throws away",
    "exactly the distinctions this app depends on - ToolId, PriceUnit,",
    "temp_unit 'C' | 'F', and the four density resolution states. So the narrow",
    "types stay, and this snapshot plus scripts/check-types-against-schema.mjs",
    "prove they still describe the real tables.",
    "",
    "Refresh after a migration, then run: npm run schema:check",
    "",
    "REFRESH IT WITH THE TWO QUERIES IN `_generated_by`, not by hand. The 0030",
    "refresh found that `guard_locked_plan` and `guard_locked_plan_child` (both",
    "from migration 0021) had never been in `_functions` at all - an earlier",
    "refresh had listed the functions by hand and missed two. Nothing was hidden",
    "by it (neither is callable by a client role), but a function missing from",
    "here is a function whose grants nothing checks, which is the opposite of",
    "what this file is for."
  ],
  "_generated_by": {
    "tables": [
      "select jsonb_object_agg(t, cols order by t) from (",
      "  select c.table_name as t, jsonb_object_agg(c.column_name,",
      "           case when c.is_nullable = 'YES' then 'nullable' else 'required' end",
      "           order by c.column_name) as cols",
      "    from information_schema.columns c",
      "    join information_schema.tables tb on tb.table_schema = c.table_schema",
      "     and tb.table_name = c.table_name",
      "   where c.table_schema = 'public' and tb.table_type in ('BASE TABLE','VIEW')",
      "   group by c.table_name) s;"
    ],
    "functions": [
      "select jsonb_object_agg(name, info order by name) from (",
      "  select p.proname as name, jsonb_build_object(",
      "           'args', coalesce((select jsonb_agg(a.nm order by a.ord)",
      "                               from unnest(p.proargnames, p.proargmodes)",
      "                                      with ordinality as a(nm, md, ord)",
      "                              where a.md is null or a.md in ('i','b')), '[]'::jsonb),",
      "           'security_definer', p.prosecdef,",
      "           'anon_execute', has_function_privilege('anon', p.oid, 'execute'),",
      "           'authenticated_execute', has_function_privilege('authenticated', p.oid, 'execute')",
      "         ) as info",
      "    from pg_proc p join pg_namespace n on n.oid = p.pronamespace",
      "   where n.nspname = 'public' and p.prokind = 'f') s;"
    ]
  },
